Step 5 Analysis:
This is a known module implementation bug where imageReference.publisher and offer are not being properly implemented in the module. Similar errors documented in other test cases (otherEdgeZone, otherGalleryApplicationRemoved, otherTagsUpdated). The module is not correctly passing the publisher/offer fields to the Azure API.

This is a module-level bug that cannot be fixed at the test configuration level without modifying the core module implementation.

